2.Inside foodie-profile.html, add headings and paragraphs to introduce yourself as a food lover, including your favorite cuisine and a short story about your best meal.
Ans.
<h1>Welcome to My Foodie World</h1>
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>Hi, I'm a passionate food lover who thrives on exploring diverse culinary cultures and rich flavors. My absolute favorite cuisine is authentic North Indian, especially rich gravies, tandoori specialties, and freshly baked naan.</p>
    
    <h2>My Best Meal Story</h2>
    <p>My most memorable meal was during a trip when I visited an old roadside dhaba. We ordered butter chicken and garlic naan cooked in a traditional clay tandoor. 
    The smoky aroma, perfectly balanced spices, and melting butter created an unforgettable taste experience that sparked my lifelong love for great food!</p>


